<title>SRI LANKA: Three Acre makes loss in 1996.</title>
<headline>Three Acre makes loss in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Three Acre Farms Ltd, for the year ended December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				1996		1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	     171.33    vs    229.07</p>
<p>    Net profit/(loss)   (0.36)   vs     67.35</p>
<p>    Tax			3.78    vs     27.17</p>
<p>NOTE - Three Acre Farms Ltd, which supplies day-old-chicks, was badly hit by crippling power cuts in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
